{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2020-004","published":"2020-02-19T17:22:22Z","modified":"2026-09-10T03:45:33.645630794Z","details":"The Profile module enables you to allow users to have configurable user profiles.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently check access when creating a user profile. Users with the \"create profiles\" permission could create profiles for any users.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/profile","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/profile?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.0.0"},{"last_affected":"1.0.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"1.0.0"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"1.0.0","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/profile/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2020-004.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2020-004"}],"credits":[{"name":"karl972","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/user/1541584"]}]}